;
TITL 3-brpy-pbbr3_a.res in P2(1)/c
REM Old TITL 3-BrPy-PbBr3 in P2(1)/c
REM SHELXT solution in P2(1)/c
REM R1 0.126, Rweak 0.007, Alpha 0.039, Orientation as input
REM Formula found by SHELXT: Br4 Pb
