ZERR 4 0.000345 0.000245 0.000706 0 0.0042 0
LATT 1
SYMM -X,0.5+Y,0.5-Z
SFAC C H Br N Pb
UNIT 20 20 16 4 4

L.S. 20
PLAN  7
